#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid ""
"B<strchr>(), B<strrchr>(): POSIX.1-2001, POSIX.1-2008, C99, SVr4, 4.3BSD."
msgstr ""
"B<strchr>(), B<strrchr>() : POSIX.1-2001, POSIX.1-2008, C99, SVr4, 4.3BSD."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid "B<strchrnul>()  is a GNU extension."
